 "info": {
  "description": "Bounded simulator subset of the official AWS Amplify API (2017-07-25). Every other official operation returns HTTP 501 UnknownOperationException. Apps and branches are configuration metadata: no repository connection, OAuth or access token, build, deployment, hosting or domain is created. oauthToken, accessToken and basic-auth credentials are refused. Deleting an app with branches is refused until the branches are deleted.",
  "title": "AWS Amplify (simulator catalog)",
  "version": "2017-07-25"
 },
